02:00:43.840 --> 02:00:45.840
But why did we put two different things here?

02:00:45.840 --> 02:00:47.840
We could have put one thing

02:00:47.840 --> 02:00:49.840
or we could have got the bag

02:00:49.840 --> 02:00:51.840
and the person scanned.

02:00:51.840 --> 02:00:53.840
The problem is

02:00:53.840 --> 02:00:55.840
that when

02:00:55.840 --> 02:00:57.840
one system checks our guardrail

02:00:57.840 --> 02:00:59.840
and also gives a response

02:00:59.840 --> 02:01:01.840
then the chance increases

02:01:01.840 --> 02:01:03.840
that the check

02:01:03.840 --> 02:01:05.840
methodology

02:01:05.840 --> 02:01:07.840
leaks in response.

02:01:09.840 --> 02:01:11.840
Because one system is checking

02:01:11.840 --> 02:01:13.840
and one system is giving a response

02:01:13.840 --> 02:01:15.840
so it knows about both

02:01:15.840 --> 02:01:17.840
things. Both are interrelated.

02:01:17.840 --> 02:01:19.840
What we have done here?

02:01:19.840 --> 02:01:21.840
We are giving a check

02:01:21.840 --> 02:01:23.840
to a different person

02:01:23.840 --> 02:01:25.840
and that person is just checking

02:01:25.840 --> 02:01:27.840
