02:01:27.840 --> 02:01:29.840
So he will tell us

02:01:29.840 --> 02:01:31.840
how he is checking internally.

02:01:31.840 --> 02:01:33.840
And the other person

02:01:33.840 --> 02:01:35.840
we have simply told him

02:01:35.840 --> 02:01:37.840
that you have to generate a response

02:01:37.840 --> 02:01:39.840
on the basis of pass or fail.

02:01:39.840 --> 02:01:41.840
You don't know that the person

02:01:41.840 --> 02:01:43.840
