02:01:43.840 --> 02:01:45.840
is dependent on which logic.

02:01:45.840 --> 02:01:47.840
So what we have done here?

02:01:47.840 --> 02:01:49.840
We have implemented separation of concern.

02:01:49.840 --> 02:01:51.840
We have divided

02:01:51.840 --> 02:01:53.840
one particular component into two.

02:01:53.840 --> 02:01:55.840
The first component is just telling the result

02:01:55.840 --> 02:01:57.840
and not giving a response.

02:01:57.840 --> 02:01:59.840
It is simply telling a true or false.

02:01:59.840 --> 02:02:01.840
The second one is reading

02:02:01.840 --> 02:02:03.840
the true or false and giving a response.

02:02:03.840 --> 02:02:05.840
He doesn't know how to generate true or false.

02:02:05.840 --> 02:02:07.840
If false is coming then he is giving a response

02:02:07.840 --> 02:02:09.840
and if true is coming then he is giving a response.

02:02:09.840 --> 02:02:11.840
So what happens with this?

02:02:11.840 --> 02:02:13.840
Basically with this two step process

02:02:13.840 --> 02:02:15.840
we can

02:02:17.840 --> 02:02:19.840
save guard the implementation details

02:02:19.840 --> 02:02:21.840
or implementation logic.

